# SSDD (Cursor)

Read `AGENTS.md` first. For non-trivial work, also read `.ssdd/process/SDD.md`.

Never `git add -A`, `git add .`, `git commit --no-verify`, `git commit --amend`,
or force-push. Stage files by path.

When the review gate blocks, dispatch the reviewers it names in parallel with
the Task tool (the reviewers routed in `.ssdd/config.json`; checklists in
`.ssdd/reviewers/*.md`) against the files each one owes. Then
`node .ssdd/hooks/review-gate.mjs --stamp <reviewer,…>` (`--files` for a
delta round, `--repo` for another work tree). Do not stamp without running
them. Stage and commit in separate shell calls.

Mechanical hooks: `.cursor/hooks.json` runs the same `.ssdd/hooks` scripts
Claude Code registers in `.claude/settings.json`.
